From f1c6449c2385e9e2908fe0c62c957a5b5056ddbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: barracuda156 <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:25:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 57/60] v8: Word32Constant(sizeof(int32_t)) is ambiguous where
 size_t is unsigned long

Int64LoweringReducer::IncreaseOffset (new at 13.6) falls back to

    new_index = __ Word32Constant(sizeof(int32_t));

when the lowered high-word offset no longer encodes.  Word32Constant
has a uint32_t and an int32_t overload.  On Darwin, size_t is
`unsigned long` on every target (32-bit included), so neither
overload is an exact match and GCC reports "call of overloaded
'Word32Constant(long unsigned int)' is ambiguous".  On the 32-bit
Linux targets upstream builds (ia32, arm, riscv32) size_t is
`unsigned int` == uint32_t, and 64-bit Darwin never instantiates
the reducer (V8_TARGET_ARCH_32_BIT only), which is why upstream
never sees it.

Cast the operand to uint32_t.  Upstream main has since restructured
IncreaseOffset around base::bits::WraparoundAdd32 and no longer has
this line, so there is nothing to cherry-pick.

Sweep (Darwin's size_t/uintptr_t are `unsigned long`, so any
uint32_t/int32_t overload pair fed a size_t in 32-bit-only code is
this class; Word32Constant and Word64Constant are the only such
pairs in assembler.h): every Word32Constant/Word64Constant call in
the 74 32-bit-only preprocessor regions of v8/src outside the
backend directories (30 calls, all int literals, int32_t/uint32_t
variables or explicit casts), in the Int64LoweringReducer template
itself (12 calls: literals, uint32_t low/high/masked_shift_value,
and this one), and in the turboshaft and Liftoff
`if constexpr (Is64())` else branches (kMinusZeroLoBits/HiBits are
int) - exactly this site.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 v8/src/compiler/turboshaft/int64-lowering-reducer.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/v8/src/compiler/turboshaft/int64-lowering-reducer.h b/v8/src/compiler/turboshaft/int64-lowering-reducer.h
index 6cb8c25..e76301f 100644
--- a/v8/src/compiler/turboshaft/int64-lowering-reducer.h
+++ b/v8/src/compiler/turboshaft/int64-lowering-reducer.h
@@ -314,7 +314,7 @@ class Int64LoweringReducer : public Next {
       if (index.has_value()) {
         new_index = __ Word32Add(new_index.value(), add_offset);
       } else {
-        new_index = __ Word32Constant(sizeof(int32_t));
+        new_index = __ Word32Constant(static_cast<uint32_t>(sizeof(int32_t)));
       }
     }
     return {new_index, new_offset};
